    "title": "*Breaking News* Newsom Ex-Chief of Staff Indicted On 23 Counts In Major Ongoing Political Corruption Probe - NewsBreak",
    "text": "6 hours ago Inside the Indictment: A Web of Fraud and Deception. Dana Williamson—Gavin Newsom’s former chief of staff and a veteran Democratic political consultant—was arrested by the FBI this morning. The 53-year-old faces a 23-count federal indictment unsealed today in the Eastern District of California. Prosecutors say she led a years-long scheme to divert more than $225,000 from a dormant Democratic campaign fund, then covered her tracks with backdated contracts and false statements to investigators. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
